            "review_title": "Review at Cocotte - Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Leean W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam206 contributions\n0\nAlways Delicious at Cocotte\nJul 2022\nCocotte in Thao Dien is a very delicious experience and me, my husband, and friends have eaten there endlessly, so I was surprised to see that I haven't written a review before now. We have tended to eat the same meals as they are so over the top delicious that we can't drag ourselves away from our favourite dishes to try any others on offer. For my friends their main favourite is the pork knuckle, with beef in pepper sauce a close second. And just as well as when we went to the restaurant last time, my friends were very disappointed to see that the pork knuckle is no longer on the menu, at least , not as a main dish by itself. However they still very much enjoyed their second favourite, as did I, of the lean well cooked beef in super tasty pepper sauce, with Cocotte potatoes, the most delicious potatoes in town. I was sad to see that the mixed peas and carrots has also been taken off the menu as this was an excellent accompaniment to the beef in pepper sauce. The vegetable salad was still there though thank goodness, with the same refreshing, tasty dressing, and the home baked white rolls are just as delicious as ever. Again, probably the best tasting in the city even though there are many delicious versions in Ho Chi Min of the famous baguettes. Special mention must be made of the pepper sauce which really has a welcome black pepper flavour to it. Only too often some restaurants black pepper sauce is almost like a mild British gravy and not like pepper sauce at all. But here at Cocotte it is the real deal. The carafes of wine too are a super deal and the house wine is very good indeed. The food is always piping hot, which is very welcome, as only too often restaurants indifferently serve lukewarm food, and the staff are always super friendly, though rather slow to respond or to fetch anything after being asked. But the overall experience is excellent and we will return there time and time again, even though I now live in D7.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 26, 2022",
