            "review_text": "Dino\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam70 contributions\n0\nBad taste and attitude\nJan 2020\nWent there after visiting the district 1 restaurant a few times and enjoying the food and the service. My friend's order was brought cold and mine tasted bland and almost unpleasant. On top of this when I asked the waitress for a glass of water she told me that her manager told her to serve only bottled water for extra charge of course. I don't think I'll go there again, there are many other restaurants with better food and attitude.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 17, 2020",
